sequenceDiagram
    participant E as Evaluator
    participant C as Challenger (Critic)
    participant D as Defender (Analyst)
    participant J as Judge

    E->>E: Score assessment (0-40)
    E->>E: Score ≥ 32? → Trigger debate

    loop 3 Challenges
        C->>D: Challenge: [assumption/risk/blind_spot]
        D->>C: Defense: [rebuttal + evidence]
    end

    C->>J: Submit: 3 challenges + severity
    D->>J: Submit: 3 defenses + confidence
    J->>J: Evaluate argument quality
    J->>E: Verdict: proceed/reject/reconsider + score_delta
    E->>E: Adjust score by score_delta
    E->>E: Append to RunTrace audit trail
